#: ../../source/users/interface/search_menu.rst:7
msgid "Search menu"
msgstr "搜索菜单"

#: ../../source/users/interface/search_menu.rst:9
msgid ""
"The search menu allows searching `elements`_, `folios`_ or `conductors`_ "
"which have a text field or property with an specific value. The search menu "
"allows finding automatically an `element`_ with a desired label, list the "
"`folios`_ from an specific author, etc."
msgstr ""
"搜索菜单允许搜索具有特定值的文本字段或属性的 `元件 <elements_>`_，`图幅 <folios_>`_ 或 `导体 "
"<conductors_>`_。搜索菜单允许自动找到带有理想标签的 `元件 <element_>`_，从特定作者中列出 `图幅 <folios_>`_ "
"等。"

#: ../../source/users/interface/search_menu.rst:13
msgid ""
"QElectroTech provides a basic and simple search menu composed by a text box "
"which allows writing the desired string which should be found and some "
"buttons for closing the menu, actualizing the search and going to next and "
"previous coincidence."
msgstr ""
"QElectroTech "
"提供了一个由文本框构成的基本而简单的搜索菜单，它允许写出应该找到的想要的字符串和关闭菜单的一些按钮，实现搜索并前往下一个和之前的巧合。"

#: ../../source/users/interface/search_menu.rst:20
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech search menu"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech搜索菜单"

#: ../../source/users/interface/search_menu.rst:22
msgid ""
"QElectroTech also provides an advanced menu where filters can be defined "
"inside `folios`_, `text fields`_, `elements`_ and `conductors`_ trees. The "
"advanced mode also allows replacing actions."
msgstr ""
"QElectroTech还提供了高级菜单，在 `图幅 <folios_>`_，`文本字段 <text fields_>`_，`元件 "
"<elements_>`_ 和 `导体 <conductors_>`_ 树内可以定义过滤器。高级模式还允许替换动作。"

#: ../../source/users/interface/search_menu.rst:28
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech advanced search menu"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech高级搜索菜单"

#: ../../source/users/interface/search_menu.rst:30
msgid "To display or hidden the search menu:"
msgstr "要显示或隐藏搜索菜单："

#: ../../source/users/interface/search_menu.rst:32
msgid ""
"Select **Edit > Search / Replace** menu item to display or hidden the search"
" menu at the bottom from the `workspace`_."
msgstr "选择 **Edit > 搜索 / 替换** 菜单项，从 `工作区 <workspace_>`_ 中显示或隐藏底部的搜索菜单 。"

#: ../../source/users/interface/search_menu.rst:36
msgid ""
"The search menu can also be displayed using ``Ctrl + f`` shortcut keyboard."
msgstr "搜索菜单也可以使用 ``Ctrl + f`` 快捷键盘显示。"
